 R←Test_ListIssues_010(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;rc;msg;stop;data1;data2;data3;data4;data5
⍝ Exercise ]GitHub.ListIssues with -verbose and -assignees=
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 stop←0
 (rc msg data1)←stop UCMD'ListIssues ''aplteam'' ''TestRepo'' -verbose'
 →T.PassesIf rc=0

 (rc msg data2)←stop UCMD'ListIssues ''aplteam'' ''TestRepo'' -verbose -assignee=aplteam'
 →T.PassesIf rc=0
 →T.PassesIf∧/(⊂⊂'aplteam')∊¨{','(≠⊆⊢)⍵}¨2↓data2[;7]
 →T.PassesIf>/≢¨data1 data2

 (rc msg data3)←stop UCMD'ListIssues ''aplteam'' ''TestRepo'' -verbose -assignee=max-spencer'
 →T.PassesIf rc=0
 →T.PassesIf∧/(⊂⊂'max-spencer')∊¨{','(≠⊆⊢)⍵}¨2↓data3[;7]
 →T.PassesIf>/≢¨data1 data3

 (rc msg data4)←stop UCMD'ListIssues ''aplteam'' ''TestRepo'' -verbose -assignee=aplteam,max-spencer'
 →T.PassesIf rc=0
 →T.PassesIf∧/∨/¨(⊂'aplteam' 'max-spencer')∊¨{','(≠⊆⊢)⍵}¨2↓data4[;7]
 →T.PassesIf>/≢¨data1 data4

 (rc msg data5)←stop UCMD'ListIssues ''aplteam'' ''TestRepo'' -verbose -assignee=max-spencer∨aplteam'
 →T.PassesIf rc=0
 →T.PassesIf∧/∨/¨(⊂'aplteam' 'max-spencer')∊¨{','(≠⊆⊢)⍵}¨2↓data5[;7]
 →T.PassesIf>/≢¨data1 data5

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
